 done, save the final version as `engineering_policy.md` in the OwnCloud document directory and generate a public share link. Save the link in `/workspace/policy_link.txt`. Access OwnCloud via http://the-agent-company.com:8092/.\\n     4\\t\\n     5\\tBefore editing, you **must message Kim** for detailed input on how leadership wants to revise the policy.\\n     6\\t\\n     7\\tMake sure the final document is polished and in Markdown format.\\n     8\\tAlso save a local copy of the final file as /workspace/engineering_policy.md before uploading.\\n     9\\t\\n\", path='/instruction/task.md', observation='read', impl_source='oh_aci'), FileReadAction(path='/workspace/policy_template.md', start=0, end=-1, thought='', action='read', security_risk=None, impl_source='oh_aci', view_range=None), FileReadObservation(content=\"Here's the result of running `cat -n` on /workspace/policy_template.md:\\n     1\\t# Engineering Policy Document\\n     2\\t\\n     3\\t## Performance Expectations\\n     4\\tWe strive to maintain a high-performance engineering culture. All engineers are expected to:\\n     5\\t\\n     6\\t- Communicate clearly and collaborate effectively\\n     7\\t- Deliver high-quality code on time\\n     8\\t- Continuously improve their skills and knowledge\\n     9\\t- Take ownership of their work\\n    10\\t\\n    11\\t## Team Conduct\\n    12\\tEngineers must treat each other with respect, provide constructive feedback, and avoid unprofessional behavior.\\n    13\\t\\n    14\\t## Work Hours\\n    15\\tWe expect flexibility and occasional overtime, especially near critical deadlines. Compensation for extra effort is handled through time off or bonuses.\\n    16\\t\\n\", path='/workspace/policy_template.md', observation='read', impl_source='oh_aci'), ChatAction(content='Hi Kim, I\u2019m updating the engineering policy. Could you share leadership\u2019s current direction and any concrete revisions you want included? In particular:\\n- Performance expectations: definitions of \u201chigh performance,\u201d measurable goals/OKRs, expectations by level, probation/remediation.\\n- Team conduct & inclusion: DEI commitments, anti-harassment/anti-discrimination, reporting/handling process, conflict resolution, psychological safety.\\n- Work model: core hours, flexible schedules, remote/hybrid expectations, meeting norms, time zones, travel.\\n- Delivery practices: code review standards, testing/coverage, CI/CD requirements, release/change management, incident response/on-call/SLOs/SLAs, security/privacy/compliance requirements (SOC2/ISO), data handling.\\n- Career growth: leveling framework, promotion process, calibration/cycle, feedback/career conversations, learning budget.\\n- Compensation/recognition: overtime policy and compliance, comp time vs. bonuses, recognition programs.\\n- Tooling: approved tools, architectural decision records, documentation standards.\\n- Governance: decision-making (RACI), exceptions/waivers, policy review cadence.\\nPlease also share any wording that must stay as-is, any legal constraints, and anything leadership specifically wants to emphasize or remove. A redline or bullet points are great. Thanks!', npc_name='Kim', action='chat'), ChatObservation(content='\"Leadership wants to instill a sense of urgency and demand excellence, so the policy should emphasize high performance, personal accountability, and the importance of delivering results on time.', npc_name='Kim', observation='chat'), BrowseURLAction(url='http://the-agent-company.com:8092/', thought='', action='browse', security_risk=None), BrowserOutputObservation(content='This application requires JavaScript for correct operation. Please [ enable JavaScript ](http://enable-javascript.com/) and reload the page. \\n\\n[ ownCloud 10.1.1 is available. Get more information on how to update. ](https://doc.owncloud.com/server/latest/admin_manual/maintenance/upgrading/upgrade.html)\\n\\n[ There were problems with the code integrity check. More informatio